  Copied into .repo/local_manifests/ by scripts/bootstrap.sh on top of the
  LineageOS lineage-23.2 manifest. These are the projects LineageOS normally
  fetches through `breakfast Q25` (device tree + lineage.dependencies) plus the
  proprietary blobs, pinned to exact commits so a build is reproducible.

  The "github" remote is defined by the LineageOS manifest (https://github.com/).
  Keep revisions in sync with build/config/q25.env (tests/run.sh checks this).
-->
